    description: "PlazaFlow Cohorts 1, 2, 3, 4, 6: React is the most common frontend framework in the corpus but hypergumbo has no React-specific detection. Three gaps: (1) ReactDOM.createRoot/render not detected as entrypoints, (2) no component-renders-component edges from JSX usage, (3) no React Router client-side route detection. These affect understanding, refactoring, and new-feature scores across the majority of repos."  # 1a47
